/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 75 0 R
/T (Mechanical Engineering student with a strong focus on UAVs, aerospace systems, and advanced engineering design. Experienced in mathematical modeling, topology optimization using nTop, fluid flow analysis with ANSYS Fluent, and structural analysis with ANSYS Mechanical. Proficient in SolidWorks, Siemens NX, ANSYS, XFLR5, and nTop for design, simulation, and performance evaluation. Also has experience working with composite materials in engineering applications. Eager to apply these skills to the development of innovative aerospace, robotics, and autonomous systems.)
/E (Mechanical Engineering student with a strong focus on UAVs, aerospace systems, and advanced engineering design. Experienced in mathematical modeling, topology optimization using nTop, fluid flow analysis with ANSYS Fluent, and structural analysis with ANSYS Mechanical. Proficient in SolidWorks, Siemens NX, ANSYS, XFLR5, and nTop for design, simulation, and performance evaluation. Also has experience working with composite materials in engineering applications. Eager to apply these skills to the development of innovative aerospace, robotics, and autonomous systems.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [7]
>>
