/E (In this project, I developed a lightweight UAV frame by starting from a geometry model obtained from GrabCAD and evaluating its structural performance through analysis. After completing the structural analysis tests and verifying the design, we moved on to the manufacturing stage. This experience showed me how important natural and organic topologies are in lightweight engineering design, and how powerful tools like nTop can be in this process. Through this project, I became highly interested in topology-driven design and started working more deeply in this area.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
